      "blurb": "We have received the order and have entered it into our system however the following details are missing: DX CODE OR REASON FOR STUDY The attached prescription/RX is missing the DX code or reason for ",
      "body": "<div>We have received the order and have entered it into our system however the following details are missing:</div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 246, 39);\"><strong><u>DX CODE OR REASON FOR STUDY</u></strong></span></div><div><br /></div><div>The attached prescription/RX is missing the DX code or reason for the study.</div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 169, 39);\"><b>Patient ID:&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">PRE1068816-&nbsp; YUNER GUTIERREZ</span></b></span></div><div><br /></div><div>Please reply &amp; attach a new RX that include the DX code or reason for the study.</div><div><br /></div><div>We cannot schedule the patient until we receive the DX code of reason for the study.</div><div><br /></div><div>If you have any questions, please contact our scheduling dept. directly at 818-629-1169</div><div><br /></div><div>Thank you,</div><div><br /></div><div>Precise Imaging</div><div><br /></div><div><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://www.precisemri.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.PreciseMRI.com</a></div><div></div>",
